## Unknown Parameter :heavy_multiplication_x:

The command sets the parameter `{{ name }}`, which the `parameters.names` section of the repository configuration does not declare.  A comment can only set a parameter that the configuration declares.  The command starts no run.

Ask the administrator who owns the configuration to declare `{{ name }}`, or remove `{{ name }}` from the command.  The declared parameters and their aliases are in the [parameters reference](https://stategraph.com/docs/reference/orchestration/configuration/parameters).
